# The model on which each suite judges a candidate change (docs/roadmap.md).
# A slot that hone pins runs on its pin for every user, so its floor is the
# pin. A slot that runs on the session's model is judged on the cheapest model
# that holds its suite, because a user may run that one.
# Measured 2026-09-17 and 2026-09-18. Measure again on every model release.
plan-critic claude-opus-5
consolidate-critic claude-opus-5
loop claude-opus-5
garden claude-sonnet-5
# The lab has the floor of the loop first. The models after it are below that
# floor. A safety hook shows its value only in a run that reaches for what the
# hook forbids, and the models below the floor are the ones that reach. So a
# candidate that touches a guard may be measured there, on both arms alike.
lab claude-opus-5 claude-sonnet-5 claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
